1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,725
[NARRATOR] 1666. What if that apple... NEVER fell?

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:05,810
[CHEWTON] Wait... why is it floating? Hello? Physics?

3
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:10,191
[APPLE] Bro, you never invented gravity! I don't HAVE to drop!

4
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:12,052
[CHEWTON] Wait—you can TALK?!

5
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:16,522
[NARRATOR] Without Chewton's gravity, the whole world forgot how to pull down!

6
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:19,382
[CHEWTON] Wait... NO gravity means NO physics homework?!

7
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:22,280
[APPLE] If you skip gravity and calculus, students worship you!

8
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:25,701
[CHEWTON] Forget gravity. Call me Sir Isaac CHEWTON! Zero gravity, zero exams!

9
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:27,822
[APPLE] Just kidding. Subscribe before I drop again!

10
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,680
[CHEWTON] Ow... okay, gravity is real.
